<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coach USA started strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coach USA started strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it started Coach USA Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 25 in early trading Tuesday.</p>
</text>
